Usage: tsci export [options] <file>

Export tscircuit code to various formats

Arguments:
  file                    Path to the package file

Options:
  -f, --format <format>   Output format (json, circuit-json, schematic-svg,
                          schematic-pdf, pcb-svg, gerbers, readable-netlist,
                          gltf, glb, specctra-dsn, kicad_sch, kicad_pcb,
                          kicad_zip, kicad-library, srj, step, assembly-svg,
                          component-box-3mf)
  -o, --output <path>     Output file path
  --disable-parts-engine  Disable the parts engine
  --show-courtyards       Show courtyard outlines in PCB SVG output
  -h, --help              display help for command
